# MiniShop frontend entities

Apply when editing `demo-project/frontend/src/`.

## Structure

```
entities/<name>/
  types.ts       API/client types for this entity
  api.ts         RTK Query endpoints (if server-backed)
  cartSlice.ts   Redux slice (client-only entities like cart)
  components/    Entity-specific UI
  pages/         Route pages for this entity
shared/
  Layout.tsx
  components/ui/ shadcn primitives
app/
  api.ts         RTK Query base slice only
  store.ts       Register reducers + side-effect import entity api.ts
```

## Rules

- One **entity folder** per domain concept (`product`, `order`, `cart`).
- HTTP calls only via RTK Query in entity `api.ts` (built on `app/api.ts`). No raw `fetch` elsewhere.
- Types for an entity stay in that entity’s `types.ts`, not a global `types/` barrel.
- Cross-entity pages (e.g. checkout) live under the primary entity (`order/pages/`) and import other entities as needed.
- Shared layout and design system live under `shared/`, not under `entities/`.

## Adding a screen or entity

1. `entities/<entity>/types.ts`
2. `entities/<entity>/api.ts` + `import '@/entities/<entity>/api'` in `store.ts`
3. Pages/components under the same entity folder
4. Route in `App.tsx`

See `demo-project/docs/architecture.md` for the full checklist (backend + frontend).
